            <div xml:id="d88-a1">

                <pb facs="0157" n="123" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg123"/>

                <p>The inclosures are—</p>
                <p>1. Letter of the consuls general and consuls to me.</p>
                <p>2. My letter to the minister of foreign affairs.</p>
                <p>3. The reply of the minister of foreign affairs to me; translation.</p>
                <p>4. My reply to the letter of the consuls general and consuls.</p>
            </div>
